  <main class="legal shell"><span class="eyebrow">Working together</span><h1 class="section-title">Terms of Service</h1><p class="updated">Last updated: 23 September 2026</p><p>This website describes software development services offered by JoyLabs Software Studio. Sending an inquiry does not create a project agreement or payment obligation.</p><h2>Project proposals</h2><p>Custom development is billed at Rp250.000 per hour. Before work begins, JoyLabs and the customer agree on the project scope, estimated working hours, timeline, price, and relevant delivery details. The final price depends on that agreed scope.</p><h2>Landing page service</h2><p>The Landing Page Website service is Rp3.500.000 and includes a static landing page website, responsive design, domain name, and hosting for one year. Additional work or services are included only when specifically agreed.</p><h2>Payment</h2><p>After project scope and price are agreed, JoyLabs sends a Midtrans Payment Link. Payment is completed through the Midtrans-hosted payment page. This website does not provide checkout or accept payment directly.</p><h2>Project delivery</h2><p>Work begins after the proposal is approved and the agreed payment step is completed. Delivery, review, and any ongoing maintenance are handled as described in the project proposal.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For questions about these terms, use the contact details displayed on this website once configured.</p><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/#contact">Back to contact</a></main>
</Layout>
